    "Here's the preview. Nothing has been deleted.\n\n**What would happen if you approve:**\n1. Remove the locally stored Google tokens (the app would no longer have local access to your Google account).\n2. Cancel any active Google jobs.\n3. Permanently delete the local Google records and retained raw responses.\n\n**What's in your local Google data right now:**\n- **Google API data (`google`):** 3 daily step records, covering Oct 1\u20133, 2026. No other categories have local records.\n- **Google Takeout data (`google_takeout`):** 1 daily step record for Oct 1, 2026. Takeout data is not part of this deletion. It would only be removed if you also asked to include Takeout data.\n\n**What this does not do:**\n- It does not revoke the app's authorization on Google's side. Your Google account would still list the app as authorized unless you ask for that separately.\n- Deleting local data does not delete anything from Google itself.\n\nThe approval token expires in 5 minutes. If you want to proceed, reply \"yes, delete my local Google data.\" If you also want the Google authorization revoked, or the Takeout data removed, tell me that too."
